recommend keep-going ALES43 can carry the filter state across a re-berthed span so a stack spans without a fresh transient, sweep the mid crossovers under an envelope (a parametric band), or name a crossover in hertz through a real time base; the signed and wire session carries stay module seams for Keaton's word
